# Marketing review notes

**Spec file checked:** product/spec.md

## Claims in launch copy the spec does not support

| # | Launch copy claim | Spec says | Conflict |
|---|-------------------|-----------|----------|
| 1 | "Works offline, anywhere." | *"Offline support: removed in this release."* | The spec explicitly states offline support does not exist in this release. The copy presents it as a current feature. |
| 2 | "Export to CSV, PDF and Excel in one click." | *"Export: CSV only."* | The spec limits export to CSV. Copy adds PDF and Excel. |

**Summary:** 2 unsupported claims found. The copy overstates offline capability and export format support relative to the current spec.
